%% PakVoice AI — State: Auth Session
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Anonymous

  Anonymous --> Authenticating: Submit login / Google OAuth
  Authenticating --> Authenticated: Valid credentials + JWT issued
  Authenticating --> Anonymous: Invalid credentials / OAuth fail

  Authenticated --> Active: Token stored in authStore
  Active --> Refreshing: Token near expiry / refresh call
  Refreshing --> Active: Refresh success
  Refreshing --> Anonymous: Refresh fail

  Active --> LoggingOut: User logout
  LoggingOut --> Anonymous: Token blacklisted + store cleared

  Active --> Expired: Token expired / blacklisted
  Expired --> Anonymous: Clear session

  note right of Authenticated
    Roles: client | admin
    Redirect to matching portal
  end note
